<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dreco Energy rating cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dreco Energy rating cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jefferies &amp; Co said in a statement its analyst Byron Dunn cut the stock rating on Dreco Energy Services Ltd to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were unavailable.</p>
</text>
